    <description>Decorative glazed vase, 0.150 m across and 0.209 m tall, authored from primitives: ellipsoid body, cylindrical foot, neck and flared rim, with a contrasting band. Stands in for the racoon figurine on the living_room bookshelf - same role, an object the vacuum can see but not reach - at the same height so it still clears the shelf above, for 9 KB instead of 8.4 MB.</description>
